  "body": "PING reviewed several accessibility specs for AT Detection risk, but the main heuristic detection problems, as outlined in [Web Platform Design Principles Issue #293](/w3ctag/design-principles/issues/293) are differences in event objects. Since the PING is filing issues on low-risk accessibility specs, this should be considered in the higher-risk HTML spec, too.\r\n",
